title: Constrained Delegation S4U Abuse
id: f7ba7f01-b764-4c8e-8fa3-679e029c8765
status: experimental
description: Detects abuse of constrained delegation via S4U2Self/S4U2Proxy, indicated by service ticket requests (4769) impersonating a privileged user to a service the account is trusted to delegate to.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1558/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 4769
    TransmittedServices|exists: true
  condition: selection
  condition: selection
fields:
  - TargetUserName
  - ServiceName
  - TransmittedServices
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate delegation flows
level: high
tags:
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1558
